loom census em_dash=6299 middot=2989 arrow=511 ellipsis=89 en_dash=56 arrow_both=19 converted=9963 remainder=505
loom heredoc hidden_chars=3 herestrings_in_tree=0
file tools/fixtures/shell_comment_ascii_scan.sh the second meter -- # comments in .rish and .sh, heredoc bodies excluded, ceiling 505
file tools/fixtures/shell_comment_ascii_control.sh thirteen behaviors on planted repositories, and the ceiling proven from both sides
file tools/as/ascii_comment_witness.rish widened to hold both meters -- one law, two comment syntaxes, twenty readings
file .claude/rules/ascii-first.md the prevention section names both guards and what each refuses to count
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now refilled with the sweep and its findings; the address-space lap shelved to a Prior-lap row
recommend keep-going caravan_suite_witness standing off the standing roster is the next crux and it is the same class one room over -- 1,683 witnesses on disk where 56 are gated, so the question is which witnesses a roster owes a run rather than whether this one gets a row; beside it rye-learning-process/archive/ALMANAC.md carries 63 non-ASCII lines, now measurable by the meter this lap seated
